---
name: scoped-review
description: Collect a review, then decide whether to accept it or request another round.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [lead, reviewer]
---
"""
Every run has thirty minutes, including all review rounds.
"""
contract @30m => expired

"""
Scope the review clearly. After each report, accept it or ask for one more
round with a specific reason; at most three rounds fit.
"""
role lead

"""
Review what the request scopes. In a later round, address the lead's reason
and say what changed since your last report.
"""
role reviewer

"""
The change to review, its scope and the question to answer.
"""
type request
  text: text(1..2000)

"""
Findings with evidence, the scope checked and remaining uncertainty. Set request to the request
this reviews; a review of an earlier round is refused.
"""
type review
  request: ref(request)
  text: text(1..4000)

"""
The lead accepts the latest report. This ends the review; it does not approve the change.
"""
type accept

"""
The lead opens the review.
"""
state new
  """
  Send the scoped request. The reviewer then owes one report on it.
  """
  lead -> reviewer: request() awaits reviewing
    """
    Report within five minutes of the request.
    """
    => review() & deciding
     """
     No report arrived within five minutes of the request.
     """
     | @5m & review_missing

"""
The reviewer reports within five minutes. A fourth entry ends the run as exhausted.
"""
state reviewing max_entries 3 => exhausted

"""
The lead may accept or request another round; either exit must happen in two minutes.
"""
state deciding @2m => undecided
  """
  Accept the latest report.
  """
  lead -> reviewer: accept() => collected
  """
  Ask for another round: resend the request with the reason and what to look at again.
  """
  lead -> reviewer: request() => reviewing

"""
The lead accepted a report. Acting on it is a separate decision.
"""
end collected

"""
The reviewer missed the five-minute window.
"""
end review_missing

"""
The lead did not decide within two minutes of a report.
"""
end undecided

"""
Three rounds were used without acceptance; keep the last report for recovery.
"""
end exhausted
